{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03908","headline":"嵩山石淙侍宴应制 · 崔融","name":"嵩山石淙侍宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞口仙岩类削成，泉香石冷昼含清。\n龙旗画月中天下，凤管披云此地迎。\n树作帷屏阳景翳，芝如宫阙夏凉生。\n今朝出豫临悬圃，明日陪游向赤城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}